WEBVTT

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.687
(YOWLING)

00:00:12.847 --> 00:00:14.247
After him.

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:17.287
He'll lead you to Edmund.

00:00:22.127 --> 00:00:23.367
Peter.

00:00:23.967 --> 00:00:25.767
Clean your sword.

00:00:30.327 --> 00:00:34.127
Rise, Sir Peter Wolf's-Bane,

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.327
Knight of Narnia.

00:00:53.327 --> 00:00:55.607
(METAL CLANGING)

00:00:56.967 --> 00:00:59.207
(PEOPLE CHATTERING)

00:01:03.807 --> 00:01:05.487
The minotaurs will take the left flanks.

00:01:05.687 --> 00:01:08.647
We'll keep the giants in reserve
and send dwarfs in first.

00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:11.247
(GROWLING)

00:01:17.927 --> 00:01:19.447
The prisoner!

00:01:29.327 --> 00:01:31.007
(SNARLING)

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.287
(MOANING)

00:01:48.527 --> 00:01:50.647
You're not going to kill me?

00:01:53.807 --> 00:01:55.087
Not yet.

00:01:59.007 --> 00:02:00.807
We have work to do.

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:33.887
Edmund!

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:08.367
What's done is done.

00:03:08.527 --> 00:03:12.087
There is no need to speak to Edmund
about what is past.

00:03:21.407 --> 00:03:22.607
Hello.

00:03:36.927 --> 00:03:39.687
-Are you all right?
-I'm a little tired.

00:03:40.607 --> 00:03:42.327
Get some sleep.

00:03:50.447 --> 00:03:51.967
And Edmund,

00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:56.807
try not to wander off.

00:04:09.847 --> 00:04:12.807
Narnia's not going
to run out of toast, Ed.

00:04:13.967 --> 00:04:17.047
I'm sure they'll pack something up
for the journey back.

00:04:17.207 --> 00:04:18.647
We're going home?

00:04:19.687 --> 00:04:20.967
You are.

00:04:22.527 --> 00:04:25.247
I promised Mum
I'd keep you three safe.

00:04:25.927 --> 00:04:28.367
But it doesn't mean
I can't stay behind and help.

00:04:28.527 --> 00:04:30.207
But they need us.

00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:34.207
All four of us.

00:04:34.367 --> 00:04:36.167
Lucy, it's too dangerous.

00:04:36.327 --> 00:04:39.487
You almost drowned!
Edmund was almost killed!

00:04:39.647 --> 00:04:41.847
Which is why we have to stay.

00:04:44.407 --> 00:04:48.687
I've seen what the White Witch can do.
And I've helped her do it.

00:04:50.367 --> 00:04:53.887
And we can't leave these
people behind to suffer for it.

00:05:01.327 --> 00:05:03.487
I suppose that's it then.

00:05:05.247 --> 00:05:07.127
Where are you going?

00:05:08.527 --> 00:05:10.687
To get in some practise.

00:05:27.207 --> 00:05:28.367
(CHUCKLING)

00:05:28.527 --> 00:05:30.127
(NEIGHING)

00:05:34.047 --> 00:05:37.207
PETER: Come on, Ed! Sword point up,
like Oreius showed us.

00:05:37.367 --> 00:05:39.367
EDMUND: En garde!
PETER: Now block.

00:05:40.927 --> 00:05:43.407
-Hey!
-Peter! Edmund!

00:05:44.847 --> 00:05:46.407
Whoa, horsie!

00:05:47.367 --> 00:05:49.127
My name is Philip.

00:05:50.247 --> 00:05:51.607
Sorry.

00:05:51.807 --> 00:05:54.767
The Witch has demanded
a meeting with Aslan.

00:05:55.727 --> 00:05:57.647
She's on her way here.

00:06:00.207 --> 00:06:01.807
Jadis, the Queen of Narnia!

00:06:01.967 --> 00:06:06.167
-MAN 1: Go away, Witch!
-Empress of the Lone Islands!

00:06:06.727 --> 00:06:09.567
-MAN 2: You don't belong here!
-Go away!

00:06:11.047 --> 00:06:12.527
(GROWLING)

